  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien new children's song for sing-and-dance actions. Ukulele strumming a bouncy four-four; glockenspiel and toy piano doubling the tune; a recorder hook between lines; hand claps, shakers and wood block on the beat; a bouncy tuba-like synth bass. Bright, clean and close, like a school-hall recording, the voices and glockenspiel forward. A warm adult leader singing each call, with a bright unison children's chorus answering on the written response lines and joining the whole chorus. 116 BPM, C major. Silly, bouncy and in a hurry. No trap beat, no EDM drop, no ballad section, no adult diva runs, no autotune.",
